### Plans

- Revisit overnight-gap reversal using a less restrictive volatility normalization and explicit minimum-history handling.
- Test gap reversal conditional on cross-asset dispersion rather than broad-market breadth.
- Continue rolling monitoring of the rank-average and residual reversal candidates, which have positive but sub-threshold full-history stability.
- Maintain the strict IC/ICIR gates and avoid persistence until both requirements are satisfied.

