The residual-trend factor passed the absolute daily IC magnitude narrowly, but its daily ICIR was strongly negative. Its multi-day performance was consistently adverse, with increasingly negative IC through the ten-day horizon. The apparent 2027 subperiod rebound was not sufficient to offset the poor broader validation:

